self.KB_CONTENT["card:779426"]={"id":"card:779426","ty":"card","sourceId":"779426","title":"『委外進貨單建立作業(IDL)』中的『專案代號 (TI032)』為何？","ver":"GP4以上","topic":"進貨單","keywords":["進貨單","品號","專案","類型"],"y":"other","answer":"* 類型為正式品號時，[F3]品號專案資料查詢(INVLD-01)。* [F2]專案代號資料查詢(CMSNB-02)。","links":[],"pdfText":"","pdfPages":0,"pdfChars":0,"merged":[],"file":"kb-cards.jsonl"};
